  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AMS-Arbetsf&#xf6;rmedlingar</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Labour Market Measures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued cooperation between the Swedish National Labour Market Board, AMS, and the Latvian State Employment Board, LSEB, aiming at strengthening the capacity at both central and local level as to planning, organising and evaluating active labour market measures. Twomodel labour offices will be supported by Swedish assistance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ett fortsatt samarbete mellan Arbetsmarknadsstyrelsen och Latvian State Employment Board, med syfte att &#xf6;ka kapaciteten p&#xe5; b&#xe5;de lokal och central niv&#xe5; i planering, organisation och utv&#xe4;rdering av aktiva arbetsmarknads&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder. Tv&#xe5; modell kontor med svensk assistans kommer att s&#xe4;ttas upp.</narrative>
  </description>
